# Vercel serves only the static frontend; the Python backend runs on Render.
# Without this, Vercel sees requirements.txt, installs it on Python 3.14, and
# fails building libsql-experimental (no 3.14 wheel). Allowlist, not denylist,
# so a new top-level Python file cannot trigger that again.
/*
!/web
!/scripts
!/vercel.json
